    "created_at": "2017-06-12T18:12:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-12T18:12:59Z",
    "body": "I wonder if this is actually implemented in the way it implies, or if e.g. setting `nodeValue` also sets the raw value.\r\n\r\nMy guess is that what we want is a hook in https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-replace ? Or maybe even further ranging then that; e.g. what happens if you insert a text node?\r\n\r\nThis seems pretty poorly specified, as-is :(. See also https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2411 and https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2424 which touch in the impact of textContent, and other changes to the value, on text selection. /cc @tkent-google @bzbarsky since they were involved in those bugs.",
